      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01395",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "然而，弹海和尚是不受任何东西拘束的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "However, the monk Tankai was not bound by anything.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01395",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他初次见我，就滔滔不绝，爽朗地说：你很像令首。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The first time he met me, he spoke on and on in a cheerful voice, saying, \"You look very much like Reishu.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01395",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你已经健康地长大成人了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You have grown up healthy and become a man.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01395",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "今尊辞世了，实在可惜啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is truly a pity that Konson has passed away!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01395",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "等等。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And so on.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
